IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g7-interpretation`
IMPORT `g7-art21-23-expressions`
IMPORT `g7-art24-25-powers`
IMPORT `g7-commencement`
IMPORT `g7-vintages`

-- ind-b-tests-fixtures-g7: the fixtures of test author ind-b for Articles 21 to 25, commencement and the vintages (group G7).  No assertions: the facts here are
-- the scenarios of work/ind-b/expectations.md, put into the shapes of the G7 modules.

§ `ind-b fixtures for Part 6, commencement and vintages`

GIVEN p IS A TYPE
      a IS A TYPE
      d IS A DEONTIC p a
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind-b7 nothing is owed under` d MEANS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN FULFILLED THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

`ind-b7 A` MEANS `the favoured interpretation`

-- An entity: a kind of Article 2(1) and whether it is a Jersey entity (both decided by G1; inputs here).
GIVEN kinds IS A LIST OF `Kind of entity`
      jersey IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN Entity
`ind-b7 entity` kinds jersey MEANS
    Entity WITH
        name IS "the test entity"
        `standing on the register` IS `not on the register`
        `kinds of entity` IS kinds
        `is a Jersey entity` IS jersey
        governors IS EMPTY
        purposes IS EMPTY

`ind-b7 a Jersey company` MEANS `ind-b7 entity` (LIST `a company`) TRUE
`ind-b7 a foreign company` MEANS `ind-b7 entity` (LIST `an entity substantially similar to one of the above, established under the law of another jurisdiction`) FALSE

GIVEN k IS A BOOLEAN
      s IS A BOOLEAN
      r IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Awareness of a fact under Articles 21 to 23`
`ind-b7 aware` k s r MEANS `Awareness of a fact under Articles 21 to 23` WITH knows IS k, suspects IS s, `reasonable grounds to suspect` IS r

`ind-b7 knows` MEANS `ind-b7 aware` TRUE FALSE FALSE
`ind-b7 suspects` MEANS `ind-b7 aware` FALSE TRUE FALSE
`ind-b7 has grounds` MEANS `ind-b7 aware` FALSE FALSE TRUE
`ind-b7 unaware` MEANS `ind-b7 aware` FALSE FALSE FALSE

GIVEN unregistered IS AN `Awareness of a fact under Articles 21 to 23`
      jerseyEntity IS AN `Awareness of a fact under Articles 21 to 23`
      neither IS AN `Awareness of a fact under Articles 21 to 23`
      conditions IS AN `Awareness of a fact under Articles 21 to 23`
GIVETH AN `Awareness of the person making a statement`
`ind-b7 awareness` unregistered jerseyEntity neither conditions MEANS
    `Awareness of the person making a statement` WITH
        `that the entity is not a registered charity` IS unregistered
        `that the entity is a Jersey entity` IS jerseyEntity
        `that the entity is neither a Jersey entity nor an excepted foreign charity` IS neither
        `that the entity does not meet all of the conditions of Article 23(3)` IS conditions

`ind-b7 aware of everything` MEANS `ind-b7 awareness` `ind-b7 knows` `ind-b7 knows` `ind-b7 knows` `ind-b7 knows`
`ind-b7 aware of nothing` MEANS `ind-b7 awareness` `ind-b7 unaware` `ind-b7 unaware` `ind-b7 unaware` `ind-b7 unaware`

GIVEN mislead IS A BOOLEAN
      property IS A BOOLEAN
      financial IS A BOOLEAN
      other IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Intent of the person making a statement`
`ind-b7 intent` mislead property financial other MEANS
    `Intent of the person making a statement` WITH
        `to cause the other person to be misled as to the nature of the entity` IS mislead
        `to cause the other person to give the entity any property` IS property
        `to cause the other person to give the entity a financial advantage` IS financial
        `to cause the other person to give the entity some other advantage` IS other

`ind-b7 to get donations` MEANS `ind-b7 intent` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE
`ind-b7 to mislead` MEANS `ind-b7 intent` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind-b7 to get a free venue` MEANS `ind-b7 intent` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
`ind-b7 with no intent` MEANS `ind-b7 intent` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

-- Parties (a / the / another, 2026-10-27): this file builds its own values.  Two parties are the same party when name AND identifier are equal.
GIVETH A Party
`ind-b7 the entity as a party` MEANS Party WITH name IS "An entity", identifier IS "E-1"

GIVETH A Party
`ind-b7 a third party` MEANS Party WITH name IS "A third party", identifier IS "P-1"

GIVETH A Party
`ind-b7 a donor` MEANS Party WITH name IS "A donor", identifier IS "D-1"

-- A statement: what is said; in connection with Jersey activities; made by the entity itself; caused or permitted by it; the awareness and intent of its maker.
GIVEN what IS A `What is said of an entity`
      inJersey IS A BOOLEAN
      itself IS A BOOLEAN
      permitted IS A BOOLEAN
      awareness IS AN `Awareness of the person making a statement`
      intent IS AN `Intent of the person making a statement`
GIVETH A `Statement about an entity under Articles 21 to 23`
`ind-b7 statement` what inJersey itself permitted awareness intent MEANS
    `Statement about an entity under Articles 21 to 23` WITH
        `what is said of the entity` IS what
        `in connection with an activity of the entity in Jersey` IS inJersey
        `the entity as a party` IS `ind-b7 the entity as a party`
        `the person making the statement` IS (IF itself THEN `ind-b7 the entity as a party` ELSE `ind-b7 a third party`)
        `the other person` IS `ind-b7 a donor`
        `the entity caused or permitted another person to make it` IS permitted
        `an exception prescribed under Article 21(8) applies` IS FALSE
        `an exception prescribed under Article 23(4) applies` IS FALSE
        awareness IS awareness
        intent IS intent

-- The same with a States' exception applying (Articles 21(8) and 23(4)).
GIVEN what IS A `What is said of an entity`
GIVETH A `Statement about an entity under Articles 21 to 23`
`ind-b7 an excepted statement that it is` what MEANS
    `Statement about an entity under Articles 21 to 23` WITH
        `what is said of the entity` IS what
        `in connection with an activity of the entity in Jersey` IS TRUE
        `the entity as a party` IS `ind-b7 the entity as a party`
        `the person making the statement` IS `ind-b7 the entity as a party`
        `the other person` IS `ind-b7 a donor`
        `the entity caused or permitted another person to make it` IS FALSE
        `an exception prescribed under Article 21(8) applies` IS TRUE
        `an exception prescribed under Article 23(4) applies` IS TRUE
        awareness IS `ind-b7 aware of everything`
        intent IS `ind-b7 to get donations`

-- The entity itself says it, strictly (no awareness or intent).
GIVEN what IS A `What is said of an entity`
      inJersey IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Statement about an entity under Articles 21 to 23`
`ind-b7 the entity says it is` what inJersey MEANS `ind-b7 statement` what inJersey TRUE FALSE `ind-b7 aware of nothing` `ind-b7 with no intent`

-- The entity permits its agent to say it.
GIVEN what IS A `What is said of an entity`
GIVETH A `Statement about an entity under Articles 21 to 23`
`ind-b7 the entity lets its agent say it is` what MEANS `ind-b7 statement` what TRUE FALSE TRUE `ind-b7 aware of nothing` `ind-b7 with no intent`

-- A third person says it, with the awareness and intent given, in connection with Jersey activities.
GIVEN what IS A `What is said of an entity`
      awareness IS AN `Awareness of the person making a statement`
      intent IS AN `Intent of the person making a statement`
GIVETH A `Statement about an entity under Articles 21 to 23`
`ind-b7 a third person says it is` what awareness intent MEANS `ind-b7 statement` what TRUE FALSE FALSE awareness intent

`ind-b7 registered` MEANS `that it is registered by the Commissioner`
`ind-b7 charity` MEANS `that it is a “charity”`
`ind-b7 Jersey charity` MEANS `that it is a “Jersey charity”`

-- Article 22: the facts of the excepted foreign charity test.
GIVEN under IS A `Law under which an entity is established`
      entitled IS A BOOLEAN
      managed IS A BOOLEAN
      specified IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Facts for the excepted foreign charity test`
`ind-b7 foreign facts` under entitled managed specified MEANS
    `Facts for the excepted foreign charity test` WITH
        `established under` IS under
        `entitled under that law to refer to itself there as a charity` IS entitled
        `managed wholly or mainly from that jurisdiction` IS managed
        `specified in an Order under Article 22(4)` IS specified

`ind-b7 UK law` MEANS `the law of the United Kingdom or of a jurisdiction that is part of the United Kingdom`
`ind-b7 prescribed law` MEANS `the law of a jurisdiction, not Jersey or the United Kingdom or a part of it, that the Minister has prescribed by Order under Article 22(2)(a)(ii)`
`ind-b7 other law` MEANS `the law of some other jurisdiction`

-- Article 24: a use of a term.
GIVEN term IS A STRING
      byRegistered IS A BOOLEAN
      soliciting IS A BOOLEAN
      public IS A BOOLEAN
      prescribed IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Use of a relevant term under Article 24`
`ind-b7 use` term byRegistered soliciting public prescribed MEANS
    `Use of a relevant term under Article 24` WITH
        term IS term
        `by a registered charity` IS byRegistered
        `in relation to the soliciting of donations` IS soliciting
        `from the general public` IS public
        `from a prescribed description of persons` IS prescribed

-- Commencement and vintages.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
      day IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind-b7 Part` n `is in force on` day MEANS
    `Commencement: the unit of the Law is in force on` (`a Part of the Law` n) day `ind-b7 A`

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
      day IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind-b7 Article` n `is in force on` day MEANS
    `Commencement: the unit of the Law is in force on` (`an Article of the Law as now numbered` n) day `ind-b7 A`

GIVEN day IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `Office of the Minister`
`ind-b7 the Minister on` day MEANS `Endnotes: the office of the Minister on` day `ind-b7 A`

GIVEN day IS A DATE
      h IS A NUMBER
      m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `Office of the Minister`
`ind-b7 the Minister at` day h m MEANS `Endnotes: the office of the Minister at` (DATETIME_FROM_DTZ day (TIME_FROM_HMS h m 0) "Europe/Jersey") `ind-b7 A`
